# promise: #828
# Arc Max's ChatGPT in the Command Bar, as Arc 1.174 does it (measured live 27 Nov 2026, GitHub #828): with the switch
# on, "chatg" in ⌘T offers ChatGPT ("Ask ChatGPT  Tab"), Tab scopes the bar to it ("Send a Message…") and its row asks
# ChatGPT on chatgpt.com; a question in the plain bar gets the "Ask ChatGPT" row; ⌥⌘G (New ChatGPT Message) opens the
# bar already scoped to ChatGPT. Nothing is sent: the rows are read, not opened.
budget rss=700 stalls50=20
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "searchSuggestions": false, "chatGPTInCommandBar": true}
pace 0.5
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=gpt
wait 2

cra://commandbar?query=chatg
wait 1
cra://debug?commandBarScope=offered
expect-log command bar scope offered: none, .* hint Ask ChatGPT
cra://debug?commandBarScope=enter
expect-log command bar scope enter: ChatGPT, .* placeholder Send a Message…
cra://commandbar?query=what%20is%202%2B2
wait 1
cra://debug?commandBarRows=scoped
expect-log Cra command bar rows scoped: open=1 mode=newTab selected=0 other:https://chatgpt\.com/\?q=what%20is%202\+2 
cra://dismiss
wait 1

cra://commandbar?query=what%20is%20two%20plus%20two
wait 1
cra://debug?commandBarRows=plain
expect-log Cra command bar rows plain: open=1 .*other:https://chatgpt\.com/\?q=what%20is%20two%20plus%20two
cra://dismiss
wait 1

cra://action/newChatGPTMessage
wait 1
cra://debug?commandBarScope=gpt
expect-log command bar scope gpt: ChatGPT, .* placeholder Send a Message…
cra://dismiss
